        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Full jaw range of motion and mouth opening; no trismus, with discomfort at end range of chewing. Stensen ducts mildly erythematous with clear saliva; no pus expressed. Dentition okay, with no obvious caries or abscess."
      }
    },
